# Fields of Strife, a red-white surveil land: it enters tapped (so nothing is offered on turn 1), taps for {R} on turn 3 and for {W} on
# turn 5 and offers no {G}. On turn 7 its "{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Surveil 1." is refused with three Moxen that make neither {R} nor {W}, with
# {R} added but no {W}, and goes through once Mox Pearl makes the {W}: the Mountain on top of the library goes to the graveyard.

